Mycelium
Copyright 2026 tarstars

Mycelium is a modified version of Cline (https://github.com/cline/cline),
version 3.79.0, licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (see LICENSE).

Changes made in this fork:
- renamed the extension (id local.mycelium-coder) and moved its data to ~/.mycelium;
- removed calls to Cline's cloud services;
- added the Mycelium layer in src/mycelium/: task memory, stage pipeline, update-cycle,
  stage gate, command safety, metrics, Cockpit panel, and two behaviour profiles
  ("tao" and "improved") modelled on the published behaviour of TAO·CODER 3.1.2.

No code or prompt text from TAO·CODER is included.
